{"strongs": "H7925", "word": "שָׁכַם", "translit": "sha.kham", "root": "שכם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb Hiph`il denominative", "gloss": "start, rise, early", "definition": "[ שָׁכַם ] verb Hiph`il denominative start, rise, early (properly load backs of beasts for day's journey); — Perfect 3 masculine singular consecutive וְהִשְׁכִּים 2Sam 15:2 ; Job 1:5 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיַּשְׁכֵּם Gen 19:27 +, 2 masculine singular תְּשְׁכִּים Judg 9:33 , etc.; Imperative הַשְׁכֵּם Exod 8:16 +; Infinitive absolute הַשְׁכֵּם Jer 7:25 +, כֵּים - Jer 44:4 ; Prov 27:14 , erroneous אַשְׁכֵּים Jer 25:3 ( Ges «GKC:53»§ 53 K); Participle מַשְׁכִּים Hos 6:4 +, etc., — rise early, make an early start , of journey (Hexateuch only J E ); לְדַרְכְּכֶם Judg 19:9 (+ מָחָר ), compare Song 7:13 + verb of going Gen 19:2 ( J ), standing 2Sam 15:2 (compare Dr ), encamping Judg 7:1 , etc.; + infinitive 1Sam 15:12 (compare Dr ), 1Sam 29:11 ; 2Kgs 6:15 ( לָקוּם ), מַשְׁכִּימֵי קוּם Ps 127:3 (opposed to מְאַחֲרֵי שֶׁבֶת ); usually with בַּבֹּקֶר Gen 19:27 ( J ; אֶלהַֿמָּקוֺם ), 1Sam 29:10 (twice in verse) + 27 t., + (hyperbole) שֵׁכָר ׳ מַשְׁכִּימֵי בַבּ יִרְדֹּ֑פוּ Isa 5:11 (|| מְאַחֲרֵי בֵנֶּשֶׁף ); with מִמָּחֳרָת Exod 32:6 ( E ), Judg 6:28 + 3 t.; with בַּעֲלוֺת הַשַּׁחַר Josh 6:15 ( J ), 1Sam 19:26 וַיְמַהֲרוּ וַיַּשְׁכִּימוּ וַיֵּצְאוּ Josh 8:14 ( J ) they made a quick and early start; and went out ; Infinitive absolute ( Ges «GKC:113s»§ 113s ) as adverb וְהַעֲרֵב ׳ הַשׁ 1Sam 17:16 at early morning and at evening ; especially of ׳ י , in Jeremiah: ׳ הַשׁ וְדַבֵּר = speaking early and often Jer 7:13 ; Jer 35:14 and (of Jeremiah) Jer 25:3 , compare Jer 11:7 ; Jer 32:33 often וְשָׁלוֺחַ ׳ הַשׁ = sending early and often Jer 7:25 ; Jer 24:4 ; Jer 26:5 ; Jer 29:19 ; Jer 35:14 ; Jer 44:4 , also 2Chr 36:15 so verb finite הִשְׁכִּימוּ הִשְׁחִיתוּ , Zeph 3:7 = with eagerness they corrupted ( Ges «GKC:120g»§ 120g ); participle הֹלֵךְ ׳ כַּטַּל מַשְׁ Hos 6:4 like the dew departing early , Hos 13:3 ( Ges ib .). — 1Sam 9:26 read וַיִּשְׁכַּב , see שׁכב", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8674')\">BDB8674</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7925')\">H7925</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7901')\">H7901</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8673')\">BDB8673</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8675')\">BDB8675</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>שָׁכַם</bdbheb>] <b>verb Hiph`il denominative</b> <highlightword>start, rise, early</highlightword> (properly <highlight>load backs</highlight> of beasts for day's journey); — <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular consecutive <bdbheb>וְהִשְׁכִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,2)\">2Sam 15:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,5)\">Job 1:5</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיַּשְׁכֵּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,27)\">Gen 19:27</ref> +, 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תְּשְׁכִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:33\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,33)\">Judg 9:33</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׁכֵּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 8:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,16)\">Exod 8:16</ref> +; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׁכֵּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,25)\">Jer 7:25</ref> +, <bdbheb>כֵּים</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"Jer 44:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,4)\">Jer 44:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 27:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,14)\">Prov 27:14</ref>, erroneous <bdbheb>אַשְׁכֵּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 25:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,3)\">Jer 25:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:53»§ 53</sup> K); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַשְׁכִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 6:4\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,4)\">Hos 6:4</ref> +, etc., — <highlight>rise early, make an early start</highlight>, of journey (Hexateuch only <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>לְדַרְכְּכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 19:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,9)\">Judg 19:9</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מָחָר</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Song 7:13\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,13)\">Song 7:13</ref> + verb of going <ref ref=\"Gen 19:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,2)\">Gen 19:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), standing <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,2)\">2Sam 15:2</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>), encamping <ref ref=\"Judg 7:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,1)\">Judg 7:1</ref>, etc.; + infinitive <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,12)\">1Sam 15:12</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,11)\">1Sam 29:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 6:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,6,15)\">2Kgs 6:15</ref> (<bdbheb>לָקוּם</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>מַשְׁכִּימֵי קוּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 127:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"127\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"127\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,127,3)\">Ps 127:3</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מְאַחֲרֵי שֶׁבֶת</bdbheb>); usually with <bdbheb>בַּבֹּקֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,27)\">Gen 19:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; <bdbheb>אֶלהַֿמָּקוֺם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,10)\">1Sam 29:10</ref> (twice in verse) + 27 t., + (hyperbole) <bdbheb>שֵׁכָר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַשְׁכִּימֵי בַבּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>יִרְדֹּ֑פוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,11)\">Isa 5:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מְאַחֲרֵי בֵנֶּשֶׁף</bdbheb>); with <bdbheb>מִמָּחֳרָת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,6)\">Exod 32:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 6:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,28)\">Judg 6:28</ref> + 3 t.; with <bdbheb>בַּעֲלוֺת הַשַּׁחַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 6:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,15)\">Josh 6:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 19:26\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,26)\">1Sam 19:26</ref> <bdbheb>וַיְמַהֲרוּ וַיַּשְׁכִּימוּ וַיֵּצְאוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,14)\">Josh 8:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>they made a quick and early start; and went out</highlight>; Infinitive absolute (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:113s»§ 113s</sup>) as adverb <bdbheb>וְהַעֲרֵב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,16)\">1Sam 17:16</ref> <highlight>at early morning and at evening</highlight>; especially of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, in Jeremiah: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>וְדַבֵּר</bdbheb> = <highlight>speaking early and often</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,13)\">Jer 7:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 35:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,35,14)\">Jer 35:14</ref> and (of Jeremiah) <ref ref=\"Jer 25:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,3)\">Jer 25:3</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Jer 11:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,7)\">Jer 11:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:33\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,33)\">Jer 32:33</ref> often <bdbheb>וְשָׁלוֺחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׁ</bdbheb> = <highlight>sending early and often</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,25)\">Jer 7:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 24:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,24,4)\">Jer 24:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 26:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,5)\">Jer 26:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,19)\">Jer 29:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 35:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,35,14)\">Jer 35:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 44:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,4)\">Jer 44:4</ref>, also <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,15)\">